TW20 8RZ",Private,04673404,31/07/2026,Yes,,https://4th-dimension.co.uk/modern-slavery-statement,,https://modern-slavery-statement-registry.service.gov.uk/statement-summary/AEWlg7M9/2026,01/04/2025,31/03/2026,Neil  Foster  (Managing Director ),22/07/2026,Yes,,Yes,,Yes,,Yes,,Yes,,Yes,,"Financial, insurance and real estate activities",,,,£60 million to £100 million,More than 5 years,"Freedom of workers to terminate employment
