Ireland","Aldi UK and Ireland has a modern slavery resource pack program.  The resource pack is distributed to our tier 1 construction and logistics suppliers on an annual basis and includes guidance on modern slavery mitigation, incident management, grievance mechanisms and reporting processes.  It also requires these suppliers to assess their sites and supply chains for risks of modern slavery and implement actions to resolve any issues found.",Fresh produce migrant workers in the UK,Within your supply chains,"Tier 1 suppliers
