Refugees",,,"We monitor risk indicators through ongoing screening and engagement, and will deepen our engagement with the logistics sector from 2026 to strengthen understanding and mitigation of modern slavery risks. We are working to better understand what gaps in awareness exist in this area of the business and will roll out training sessions tailored to address these.","Indirect supply chains with multi tier manufacturing e.g. consumables, electronics, devices, with limited visibility beyond tier 1.",Within your supply chains,"Tier 1 suppliers
