Other vulnerable groups",Men,,Plans to address the mentioned risks vary from country to country. Some put in place remediation plans in the short-term for all employees to reach minimum living wages.,Excessive overtime,No,"Change in policy
Change in training",No,"All colleagues engaged in human rights due diligence receive regular training on the foundational protected principles, including modern slavery, as well as the associated due diligence processes.  Additionally, all Allianz employees are provided with training and support to embody the principles outlined in our Group Code of Conduct, which explicitly requires them to uphold and respect human rights in their roles at Allianz.",2026-05-29T12:53:41,https://downloads.modern-slavery-statement-registry.service.gov.uk/pdf-published/QqMEUV0f/2026/Allianz Group Modern Slavery Act Statement FY2025.pdf
